  "totalBlocks": 113,
  "translatedBlocks": 113,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41b55f1fdd7822ce",
      "translationZh": "评估 AI 生成代码的质量，一向是公认的难题。虽然人类很容易看出一段代码是否“看起来没问题”，但要确定它是否真的能正确运行、妥善处理边界情况并产生预期结果，就需要运行和测试它。正因如此，今天我们非常高兴地宣布推出 BigCodeArena——首个通过执行代码来评估代码生成模型的人机协同平台。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8cb07ce803261639",
      "translationZh": "受面向大语言模型的 LMArena 启发，我们构建了一个平台，让任何人都能并排比较代码生成模型，但有一个关键区别：你可以实际运行代码，查看它产生的结果。只需提交一个编程任务，观看两个不同的模型生成解决方案，执行这两个程序，然后投票选出结果更好的模型。评选结果会汇总成排行榜，展示社区评分最高的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89b1f4c3df983454",
      "translationZh": "动机",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f87333c1c06d9383",
      "translationZh": "代码生成领域长期以来一直难以找到可靠的评估方法。HumanEval 等传统基准使用预定义的测试用例来测试代码，但这些用例只能代表现实世界编程任务中极小的一部分。面向通用聊天机器人的人工评估平台已经存在，但它们在代码评估方面仍有不足：阅读原始源代码并在脑海中模拟其执行过程，对认知能力的要求很高，也容易出错，尤其是在程序较长或 UI 应用较复杂的情况下。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f387078b0f2ab391",
      "translationZh": "设想这样一个场景：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d35ff22c6c4d964",
      "translationZh": "你让两个 AI 模型构建一个响应式照片图库网站。两者生成的代码在语法上看起来都正确。但究竟哪个更好？不运行代码，几乎不可能判断。一个可能会生成美观且功能正常的网格布局，而另一个可能存在细微的缺陷或样式问题，只有在浏览器中渲染后才会显现出来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d643c1343b4c832f",
      "translationZh": "这一观察让我们得出了一个关键认识：执行反馈对于人类可靠地判断代码质量至关重要。这正是 BigCodeArena 所提供的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e7f6ffb319083f46",
      "translationZh": "BigCodeArena 平台",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a05a8d110a537e57",
      "translationZh": "BigCodeArena 在 Chatbot Arena 框架的基础上进行了扩展，加入了专为代码评估设计的强大功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3db7f72605936ce5",
      "translationZh": "实时执行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6dfc361eb77a2aff",
      "translationZh": "模型生成的每个代码片段都会在隔离的沙箱环境中自动执行。无论是 Python 脚本、React Web 应用、PyGame 游戏，还是 C++ 算法，你都能看到实际输出，而不仅仅是源代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "689dff1617f46f34",
      "translationZh": "多语言与框架支持",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e20b75d14aeb9b9",
      "translationZh": "我们目前支持 10 种语言（Python、JavaScript、TypeScript、HTML、C、C++、Java、Go、Rust 和 Markdown）以及 8 种执行环境：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb49033291c802d2",
      "translationZh": "Web 框架：React、Vue、Core Web（原生 HTML/CSS/JS）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "df59097308175ae0",
      "translationZh": "Python 框架：Streamlit、Gradio、PyGame",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b006af09c513dd49",
      "translationZh": "图表：Mermaid",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "21c0ac9707e370c3",
      "translationZh": "通用解释器：Python 和 JavaScript 代码解释器，以及编译型语言运行器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "78d2ed6ba929cc0b",
      "translationZh": "交互式测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "270a34f780ffc881",
      "translationZh": "与静态代码比较不同，你可以实际与生成的应用程序进行交互：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1123349d98c15b05",
      "translationZh": "点击按钮并测试 Web 应用中的 UI 元素",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f238682800b954fb",
      "translationZh": "试玩模型生成的游戏",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c5108efc930613e1",
      "translationZh": "编辑代码并重新运行，以测试修改效果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5cf9819ceebfa503",
      "translationZh": "查看绘图、图表和示意图等可视化输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0876273296b4c7f3",
      "translationZh": "多轮对话",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e05fa925697f559d",
      "translationZh": "真正的编程不是一锤子买卖。BigCodeArena 支持多轮交互，让你可以细化需求、要求添加功能或请求修复错误——就像与真正的编程助手合作一样。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "15cfa440e8f9fcc5",
      "translationZh": "我们的收获：5 个月的社区评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2964e4cf77a8ac97",
      "translationZh": "自 2025 年 2 月上线以来，BigCodeArena 已收集来自超过 500 名独立用户的逾 14,000 段对话，以及用于比较 10 个前沿 LLM 的 4,700 多次高质量偏好投票。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4268a1a611701434",
      "translationZh": "真实使用中的编程主题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9c32137c9c3a2a8",
      "translationZh": "我们的用户探索了极其多样的编程场景：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7b236d682d451a89",
      "translationZh": "网页设计（36%）：构建响应式网站、交互式仪表盘和 Web 应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4aa4ca8c121d980b",
      "translationZh": "问题求解（23%）：算法、数据结构和计算难题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "907eb1e0fb7e027d",
      "translationZh": "游戏开发（16%）：创建包含物理模拟、碰撞检测和图形效果的交互式游戏",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f6fc757aa0c41fec",
      "translationZh": "科学计算（14%）：数据分析、可视化和数值模拟",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bcc7ca8e0006973d",
      "translationZh": "创意编程（8%）：艺术可视化、生成艺术和实验性交互界面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0e8f69eb812f2b4b",
      "translationZh": "图表创建（3%）：流程图、系统架构和数据可视化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "371039400f783873",
      "translationZh": "编程语言与框架的受欢迎程度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93620998fea595c0",
      "translationZh": "Python 以超过 4,000 次对话占据主导地位，其次是 JavaScript/TypeScript（3,359）、HTML（1,601）和 C++（642）。在框架方面，直接使用 Python 解释器的使用量领先（6,000 次会话），React（2,729）、Core Web（1,574）、Streamlit（1,254）和 PyGame（1,087）的使用量也很大。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c47f3686846b0d52",
      "translationZh": "用户交互模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4451f785ff200e5f",
      "translationZh": "大多数交互都很专注且高效：76% 的对话仅包含 2 轮交互（一次请求、一次响应），平均对话长度为 4.12 条消息。不过，该平台也支持在需要时进行较长的多轮调试会话；随着用户不断完善复杂应用，一些对话会超过 10 轮。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b9871c7f19cf7f1c",
      "translationZh": "基于社区投票的模型排名",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ce1621f3b2b40b2",
      "translationZh": "我们从 14K 段对话中筛选出高质量的成对比较：对话至少包含两轮交互，且实际执行过代码。由此得到了 4,731 个投票样本，每个参评模型都获得了至少 700 票。我们使用 Bradley-Terry 模型将这些投票汇总为 Elo 评分，该模型根据直接对比结果，估计一个模型击败另一个模型的概率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3923ee8f8e3c7146",
      "translationZh": "为确保排名的稳健性，我们通过 100 次自助重采样构建 95% 置信区间，从而识别模型之间具有统计显著性的性能差异。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "968dd8ca215e5b14",
      "translationZh": "我们在三种设置下评估模型，以控制不同因素的影响：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "807e100d6eff1671",
      "translationZh": "全部数据：使用所有成对比较，不限执行环境或编程语言",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "94e17c91203e822b",
      "translationZh": "环境匹配：仅在两个模型都于相同沙箱中执行时进行比较（例如，均在 React 中或均在 PyGame 中）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9d97270d23cfda61",
      "translationZh": "语言匹配：进一步将比较限定为使用相同编程语言的情况",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "592f6779da142c1d",
      "translationZh": "在这三种设置下，排名都保持了高度一致，呈现出清晰的性能梯队：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd060022a3645080",
      "translationZh": "第一梯队：o3-mini 和 o1-mini 始终领先，Elo 评分最高，置信区间也很窄。无论环境或语言受到何种限制，这些模型都保持着顶尖性能，展现出在各种编程场景中的强大稳健性。Claude-3.5-Sonnet 紧随其后，尤其在控制编程语言这一变量时表现出色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a6772f84905eb67",
      "translationZh": "中等梯队：GPT-4o、o1 和 Gemini-2.0-Pro/Flash 构成了具有竞争力的中等梯队。GPT-4o 对语言匹配表现出一定的敏感性，表明其多语言一致性仍有提升空间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ed209ec25b6ae97",
      "translationZh": "开源模型：Qwen2.5 各变体和 Llama-3.3-70B 落后于前沿专有模型，凸显出领先的闭源模型与开源模型之间仍然存在的性能差距。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e3bde192dab94cb",
      "translationZh": "图：各模型在不同语言（左）和执行环境（右）的会话中的总体胜率热力图（在所有两两比较中获胜的百分比）。对于每个类别，我们仅保留至少出现在 3 个对话会话中的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2e4298e15b6dba24",
      "translationZh": "跨语言性能表现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "279c6b0f20953210",
      "translationZh": "按编程语言细分性能，可以发现一些有趣的规律：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba1a82dd650605b3",
      "translationZh": "o3-mini 和 o1-mini 等顶尖模型在 Python、Java 和 C++ 等主流语言中取得了具有压倒性优势的胜率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "faf3dd103664fd17",
      "translationZh": "Gemini-2.0-Pro 在 Rust 方面表现尤为出色，在该类别中取得了最高胜率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0c4f439dcd68b7e7",
      "translationZh": "不同模型展现出各自独特的专长领域，前沿模型在不同的细分领域表现突出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51b7cbab7d290675",
      "translationZh": "Qwen2.5 各变体等开放模型的表现不一致，在 Rust 和 Go 上尤其吃力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b1b11ac2502522c9",
      "translationZh": "跨执行环境的表现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37c25cb0fa7d2e13",
      "translationZh": "按执行环境分析胜率，可以揭示模型如何应对不同的运行时上下文：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c51e47d8ff820dca",
      "translationZh": "表现稳健：o3-mini 在 React、Streamlit、Gradio、Core Web 和 PyGame 中始终保持强劲表现，展现出出色的环境适应能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ab80126e1ae4360",
      "translationZh": "总体稳定，但因环境而异：Claude-3.5-Sonnet 和 Gemini-2.0-Flash 的表现总体稳定，但在 Vue 和 Mermaid 等复杂且高度依赖 UI 的环境中，胜率有所下降。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0c0da8792556bbe",
      "translationZh": "特定框架下的弱点：Qwen2.5 模型虽然在某些 Web 框架（Core Web、React）中具备竞争力，但在 PyGame、Vue 和 Mermaid 等侧重交互与可视化的环境中明显吃力。这些环境通常要求精确处理控制流、图形渲染和软件包依赖。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5bc0d47e7011256",
      "translationZh": "这些结果揭示了一个重要认识：汇总的 Elo 评分并不能反映全貌。一些模型在特定的运行时约束下仍然十分脆弱，而执行环境对实际部署有着显著影响。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "13353c880cf8fc6c",
      "translationZh": "两项新基准：BigCodeReward 和 AutoCodeArena",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64801713c6de112f",
      "translationZh": "为了推动研究超越众包评估，我们将发布两个互补的基准：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1f18cc3bfd6f1577",
      "translationZh": "BigCodeReward：评估用于代码的奖励模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b2d81fbd54985ac",
      "translationZh": "基于我们收集的 4,700+ 次偏好投票，BigCodeReward 测试了 LLM 在充当奖励模型时判断代码质量的能力。关键发现是什么？执行结果能大幅提高判断准确率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77e3498c2571881c",
      "translationZh": "当模型能够看到执行输出（网页应用截图、游戏画面、程序日志）时，其判断与人类偏好的一致性会显著提高：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec0659ca429161bc",
      "translationZh": "Claude-Sonnet-4：准确率 56.7% → 62.3%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be16d078f1cd3205",
      "translationZh": "GPT-4o：准确率 54.6% → 63.8%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "94a076398dd2bcd4",
      "translationZh": "Qwen2.5-VL-72B：准确率 58.7% → 66.2%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "078971499b1c1bf3",
      "translationZh": "这进一步印证了我们的核心论点：不运行代码，就无法可靠地判断代码——这对人类评审和 AI 评审都适用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ac1ead59a79c9bf9",
      "translationZh": "AutoCodeArena：自动化代码生成基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5bfde0c79e48170d",
      "translationZh": "受 Arena-Hard-Auto 启发，AutoCodeArena 提供了一种可扩展的新模型评估方式，无需等待数千次人工投票。我们从众包数据中精心挑选了 600 条具有代表性的提示词，涵盖所有编程主题和框架。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ddc348cdf722b31",
      "translationZh": "通过使用自动化大语言模型评判员（Claude-3.7-Sonnet），以 GPT-4.1 为基线评估代码执行结果，我们能够快速对新模型进行基准测试。这种方法使我们能够随着新模型的发布，每周更新排行榜。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dcf512ac13d18117",
      "translationZh": "我们的自动化基准测试评估了 20+ 个前沿模型，包括近期发布的系统：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70c85f33b6611546",
      "translationZh": "表现最佳的模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ef340b3c312a78db",
      "translationZh": "GPT-5 —— 以显著优势树立了新的最先进水平",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "567f2c0e268533f9",
      "translationZh": "Claude-Opus-4 和 Claude-Sonnet-4 —— 稳居第二梯队，在高度依赖推理的任务中表现出色",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d439749c810c36be",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3-Coder、Kimi-K2、GLM-4.5 —— 领先的开放模型，缩小了与中等梯队专有系统之间的差距",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b45035a841831d3",
      "translationZh": "图：近期 LLM 在 AutoCodeArena 上相对于 GPT-4.1 基线的胜率，由 Claude-3.7-Sonnet 评判。50% 标线表示与 GPT-4.1 持平。高于此线的模型优于基线，低于此线的模型则逊于基线。误差线表示 95% 置信区间。注：为避免自我评判偏差，Claude-3.7-Sonnet 不参与排名，GPT-4.1 仅作为参考基线出现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "963ee14b3ebcb902",
      "translationZh": "结果表明，尽管专有模型仍保持优势，但开源模型正在迅速缩小差距，其中一些已接近 GPT-4.1 级别的性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6cc247079cbab65d",
      "translationZh": "亲自试试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8027c4925d97e789",
      "translationZh": "BigCodeArena 向所有人开放——无需注册账号！访问 https://huggingface.co/spaces/bigcode/arena 即可：",
