    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3ce0c83a0755cc41",
      "translationZh": "探索多轮编程对话",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a8106cdb376a12e",
      "translationZh": "无论你是在构建 React 仪表板、用 PyGame 开发游戏、解决算法挑战，还是生成富有创意的可视化效果，BigCodeArena 都能让你看到哪些模型真正表现出色。",
